## Strings for @etzianco/legal-ux (consent, privacy settings, deletion, age gate,
## subscription disclosure). Purposes an app does not use are simply never asked for.

consent-banner-title = Your privacy choices
consent-banner-text = We use only what the app needs to work. Anything else stays off until you say yes.
consent-banner-policy = Read the privacy policy
consent-reject-all = Reject all
consent-accept-all = Accept all
consent-choose = Choose
consent-dialog-title = Choose what you allow
consent-dialog-text = Everything below is off until you turn it on. You can change your mind at any time in Settings.
consent-always-on = Always on
consent-save = Save my choices

