consent-purpose-necessary-desc = Keeps you signed in and remembers your settings. It cannot be turned off.
consent-purpose-preferences = Preferences
consent-purpose-preferences-desc = Remembers choices such as language and layout across visits.
consent-purpose-analytics = Usage statistics
